   "x": 0.7,
   "y": 2.15,
   "w": 4.3,
   "z": 3,
   "md": "**THE OPENING WORDS, IN BOLD CAPITALS,** set the stage the way every Appleseed report opens. State the problem and who it affects in a sentence or two.[^s1]\n\nA second paragraph says what the report found, then what it recommends. Keep paragraphs to three or four sentences.",
